<BaseLayout title="Privacy & Cookies | Campus Martius Park Guide" description="How this independent guide uses Google Analytics, a Google map and Cloudflare hosting; measurement limits and available browser choices." path="/privacy/">
<main class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-5 py-16"><h1 class="display text-5xl font-bold">Privacy and cookies</h1><p class="mt-6">Updated 30 October 2026. This independent guide is not the park operator. We do not sell tickets or take restaurant reservations here.</p>
<section class="mt-10 space-y-5 leading-8"><h2 class="text-2xl font-bold">Google Analytics</h2><p>The page automatically loads Google Analytics (GA4) and sends a configuration event; it does not wait for an on-page consent choice. Depending on browser and Google settings, Analytics can use cookies and receive page views, page URL and referrer, device/browser information, approximate location and interaction information. A script in source does not prove successful transmission in every browser. <a class="underline" href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/partner-sites">How Google uses data from partner sites</a>.</p><p>There is no analytics or cookie switch on this guide. You can use your browser’s privacy settings, block third-party scripts or cookies, or consult <a class="underline" href="https://tools.google.com/dlpage/gaoptout">Google’s Analytics opt-out information</a>. Browser blocking can affect features and does not remove previously transmitted information.</p></section>
<section class="mt-10 space-y-5 leading-8"><h2 class="text-2xl font-bold">Google Maps and external links</h2><p>The home page embeds a Google map which may load when you approach it. Loading it contacts Google and can disclose your IP address, browser details and referring page; Google may use cookies under its own settings. A lazy-loaded map is not an opt-in control. Opening directions, operator pages or ticket links takes you to those providers, whose privacy and purchase terms apply. <a class="underline" href="https://policies.google.com/privacy">Google privacy policy</a>.</p></section>
<section class="mt-10 space-y-5 leading-8"><h2 class="text-2xl font-bold">Cloudflare hosting and measurement</h2><p>Cloudflare hosts and protects this site. Edge processing can involve IP addresses, request URLs, timestamps, browser or user-agent information and security or operational logs, independently of browser analytics.</p><p>Cloudflare Web Analytics may also be enabled by the hosting configuration and inject a browser beacon for visits, page views and performance measurements. Its documented dimensions can include URL/path, referrer, country, device, browser and operating system. This is separate from Google Analytics and from hosting-edge logs. This implementation has not verified a current production beacon or a successful browser transmission. The current source CSP allows Google Analytics but does not list Cloudflare’s beacon or collection origins, so it is expected to block those browser requests while enforced; a deployed response or CSP may differ. There is no site control for hosting measurement, and blocking a browser beacon does not disable edge processing. <a class="underline" href="https://developers.cloudflare.com/web-analytics/">Cloudflare Web Analytics</a>; <a class="underline" href="https://developers.cloudflare.com/web-analytics/data-metrics/">documented data and metrics</a>; <a class="underline" href="https://www.cloudflare.com/privacypolicy/">Cloudflare privacy policy</a>.</p></section>
<section class="mt-10 space-y-5 leading-8"><h2 class="text-2xl font-bold">Site assets and local storage</h2><p>The scenic illustrations and icons are served locally. The font stack uses fonts available on your device; this source does not request a remote font service. This version retires the guide’s previous offline cache and stops intercepting navigation. It removes only caches named with this guide’s martiuspark- prefix. We do not claim to clear Google cookies or other sites’ data.</p></section><p class="mt-10"><a href="/" class="underline">Return to the visitor guide</a></p></main></BaseLayout>
